  error: VANTA_COLORS.accent.rose,
}
```

**Usage**: Replace `VANTA_COLORS.text.secondary` with `STATUS_LABEL_COLORS[status]` for colored labels. This is optional and not required by the standard dashboard card.

## Anti-Patterns (BANNED)

